@page "/"

<PageTitle>Cobrowse service</PageTitle>

<div class="page-narrow">
    <section class="home-hero">
        <h1>Cobrowse service</h1>
        <p>
            Tenant applications create support requests through the tenant API.
            Agents pick them up in the console and see the customer's page as a live
            DOM mirror, with optional control.
        </p>
        <div>
            <md-filled-button href="agent">Open agent console</md-filled-button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="home-grid">
        <article class="surface home-card">
            <h2>Tenant API</h2>
            <p>
                Tenants call <code>POST /api/v1/support-requests</code> with their tenant
                key. The response contains a short-lived join token and the hub URL the
                customer's browser uses.
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="surface home-card">
            <h2>Live mirror</h2>
            <p>
                The service relays rrweb events between the customer's browser and the
                agent console. Clicks, typing and scrolling travel back as control
                messages.
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>

    <ul class="docs-list">
        <li>Agent console: <a href="agent">/agent</a></li>
        <li>Hub endpoint: <code>/hubs/cobrowse</code></li>
        <li>Wire contract: <code>src/CobrowseService/Contracts/WireContract.cs</code></li>
    </ul>
</div>
